    "Require futureControlledExecutionIntegrityCertificationBoundaryRequired from DEV-288.",
    "Produce certification as deterministic data only.",
    "Preserve all predecessor evidence without mutation.",
    "Append DEV-289:CONTROLLED_EXECUTION_INTEGRITY_CERTIFIED to controlledExecutionIntegrityCertificationEvidence.",
    "Remain fail-closed under defaultPolicy DENY."
